<v Ira Glass>Ella and Julia and Jane say that usually, they'll get 130 to 150 likes for any selfie they put up, and anywhere between 30 and 50 comments, which is a good response. And overwhelmingly, these comments are these super-positive, you're so pretty, OMG, you're so cute kind. And a lot of it is heartfelt, girls just trying to be good friends to each other. When you see your friend put herself out there, it's nice to tell her she's pretty.
<v Ira Glass>Ella、Julia和Jane说，通常她们发的任何自拍能得到130到150个赞，以及30到50条评论，这算是不错的回应。而且绝大多数情况下，这些评论都是这种超级积极的，你太漂亮了，OMG，你太可爱了那种。很多是发自内心的，女孩们只是想彼此做个好朋友。当你看到你的朋友展示自己时，告诉她她很漂亮是件不错的事。

